---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Pre-Purchase Vehicle Valuation Service | Unitech Accident Assessor"
  description="Independent pre-purchase vehicle valuation service in Kenya with market review, document checks, and condition assessment."
  pageTitle="Pre-Purchase Vehicle Valuation Service"
>
  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <article class="article-card">
          <p class="article-lead">
            Buy smarter with an independent pre-purchase vehicle valuation from Unitech Accident
            Assessor. We help you confirm true value, spot hidden issues, and negotiate from a
            stronger position.
          </p>

          <h2>Why buyers use this service</h2>
          <ul class="content-list">
            <li>Avoid overpaying for a used vehicle</li>
            <li>Identify hidden accident or repair issues</li>
            <li>Verify logbook, engine, and chassis details</li>
            <li>Check mileage, service history, and general condition</li>
            <li>Get a professional basis for negotiation</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>What is included</h2>
          <div class="article-steps">
            <div>
              <h3>Market valuation report</h3>
              <p>Assessment based on age, mileage, condition, and current Kenya market demand.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Mechanical and structural check</h3>
              <p>Review of key systems such as engine, suspension, brakes, and transmission.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Exterior and interior review</h3>
              <p>Inspection of bodywork, tyres, upholstery, dashboard, paint, and visible wear.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Documentation review</h3>
              <p>Logbook details, ownership consistency, service records, and basic history checks.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Photos and recommendations</h3>
              <p>Clear evidence capture and practical advice on whether to proceed with the purchase.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2>How the service works</h2>
          <ol class="number-list">
            <li>Book an appointment by phone or WhatsApp.</li>
            <li>We inspect the vehicle on-site or at the seller’s location.</li>
            <li>We analyse the findings and compare with current market conditions.</li>
            <li>You receive a report within 24 to 48 hours.</li>
          </ol>
        </article>

        <aside class="sidebar-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Kenya-wide support</p>
          <h2>Fast turnaround for serious buyers.</h2>
          <p>
            This service is well suited to first-time buyers, importers, private purchases, and
            high-value vehicle deals where hidden issues can become expensive quickly.
          </p>
          <a class="button button--primary" href="https://wa.me/254755668653" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
            Start on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
